age high in the Serra de Tramuntana on Mallorca. The Valldemossa Charterhouse is what most people come for, and the village takes a few hours on foot. June to August is the settled stretch.","short_src":"rewrite","facts":{"population":1910,"visit_h":3.5}},"highlights":[{"id":"hl-serra-de-tramuntana","name":"Serra de Tramuntana","kind":"Peak","lat":39.80778,"lon":2.79361,"dist_km":18.1,"rank_score":10.29,"resolved_by":"catalogue"},{"id":"hl-valldemossa-charterhouse","name":"Valldemossa Charterhouse","kind":"Monastery","lat":39.70903,"lon":2.62231,"dist_km":0.3,"sig":2.483,"rank_score":9.8,"resolved_by":"catalogue","fact":"Monastery in Mallorca","image":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/54/Cartuja_-_Valldemosa_%284398332061%29.jpg/960px-Cartuja_-_Valldemosa_%284398332061%29.jpg","author":"Andrés Nieto Porras from Palma de Mallorca, España","licence":"CC BY-SA 2.0","licence_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cartuja_-_Valldemosa_(4398332061).jpg","ok_print":true},"wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Valldemossa_Charterhouse","heritage":true},{"id":"hl-palma-cathedral","name":"Palma Cathedral","kind":"Cathedral","lat":39.5675,"lon":2.64806,"dist_km":16.2,"rank_score":9.79,"resolved_by":"catalogue","image":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/Kathedrale_von_Palma_II.jpg/960px-Kathedrale_von_Palma_II.jpg","author":"Thomas Wolf, www.foto-tw.de","licence":"CC BY-SA 3.0 de","licence_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/de/deed.en","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Kathedrale_von_Palma_II.jpg","ok_print":true}},{"id":"hl-bellver-castle","name":"Bellver Castle","kind":"Castle","lat":39.56375,"lon":2.61934,"dist_km":16.5,"rank_score":9.46,"resolved_by":"catalogue","image":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/Castillo_de_Bellver.jpg/960px-Castillo_de_Bellver.jpg","author":"Poniol60","licence"